  "description": "Two vehicular accesses with hard standing to allow for vehicle charging.\r",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, including the formation of a vehicle crossover, associated hard surfacing, installation of electric vehicle charging infrastructure, and alterations to the boundary wall, has not been supported by an adequate arboricultural assessment. The submitted Arboricultural Report and Tree Protection Plan fail to properly assess the impact of excavation, surfacing, and associated works within the Root Protection Area of the adjacent tree. In the absence of sufficient and robust arboricultural evidence, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the proposal would not result in harm to the health and longevity of the street tree. The development is therefore cotrary to Policies CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD37 and DMD80 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), and the principles of BS5837:2012."
  ],
